<title>INDIA: India June lead output 3,076 tonnes.</title>
<headline>India June lead output 3,076 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 3,076 tonnes of lead in June against a target of 5,000 tonnes, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 8,968 tonnes of lead in April-June compared with 9,227 tonnes in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>	   Installed    June,1997	Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity</p>
<p>	   (annual)	Actual	  Apr-Jun 97  Apr-Jun 96</p>
<p>HZL	 65,000	 1,697	     5,579	5,336</p>
<p>ILL</p>
<p>Secondary 24,000	 1,379	     3,389	3,891</p>
<p>Total     89,000	 3,076	     8,968	9,227</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional. --New Delhi newsroom +91 11 301 2024</p>
